    "country": "United States",
    "excerpt": "Evil Geniuses has announced that it will cease competitive and day-to-day operations, effective November 2. The date coincides with the official end of VCT's 2026 contracts and the start of free agency ahead of the 2027 season. The statement from CEO Chris DeAppolonio shared the efforts taken by the org to continue operations, such as stabilizing operations,",
